        "en": "Tourist visa checklist",
        "zh": "旅游签证材料清单"
       },
       "body": {
        "en": "- Completed and signed application form\n- Passport valid for at least 3 months after your return, with 2 blank pages\n- Two recent passport photos (35 × 45 mm)\n- Travel insurance with minimum cover of €30,000\n- Return flight booking and hotel reservations\n- Bank statements for the last 3 months",
        "zh": "- 填写完整并签名的申请表\n- 护照有效期须在返程后至少 3 个月，并有 2 页空白页\n- 近期护照照片两张（35 × 45 毫米）\n- 保额不低于 30,000 欧元的旅行保险\n- 往返机票及酒店预订\n- 最近 3 个月银行流水"
